# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# M4 gate route (docs/architecture.md 17 M4; test/run/m4.sh): segments A
# and B of the Uplink route (test/routes/uplink.route lines 19-309, same
# ops) through two seam crossings: hldemo1 -> hldemo2 (landmark
# hldemo1to2, USEONLY: the elevator button's chain fires changetohldemo2,
# the switch is a use switch; twins startele1 and the buttons hand over,
# changetarget elestartmm opens the doors in hldemo2) and hldemo2 ->
# hldemo3 (landmark hldemo2_3, touch: the eye enters the switch box). Each
# arrival is checked exact (`waitnear <spot> 1 0`): the player keeps his
# position relative to the landmark. Stats records before and after each
# crossing (seam1-before / seam1-after, seam2-before / hldemo3) carry the
# seam, stream and rec counters the gate checks; the route ends at the
# hldemo3 arrival. Syntax and semantics: docs/formats/route-bytecode.md.
# ---- A: hldemo1, first visit: intro → dome scene → elevator → hldemo2 ----
waitmap hldemo1 600
# intro: hldemo_init_mm opens tele_init_master at 26 s; the start room's
# trigger_teleport drops the player at tele_init_destination
waitnear -2048 744 36 48 60
shot start
stats hldemo1
# dome entrance trigger_once start_script_trigger → startdometalk_mm/dometalk_mm
setpos -2048 -496 70 0 270
wait 4
setpos -2000 -620 196 0 270
wait 26
shot dome-scene
# domesci_script_3 'lean' → domesci_script_4 → start_ele_unlock_mm opens the
# multisource start_ele_lock_1 (~40 s after the dome trigger)
wait 12
# trigger_once #151 (master start_ele_lock_1) → start_ele_open_mm → startele1
setpos -2327 -230 196 0 180
# runtime-item persistence: a monster-style drop (CBaseEntity::Create) above
# the dome-view spot, away from the route; it lands at z 112. hldemo1 must
# still close when hldemo3 opens (a dropped item once kept its map open: the
# next seam waited forever) and the item must be back on hldemo1-return.
drop weapon_9mmAR -2000 -620 196
waitmoved startele1 15
waitclass weapon_9mmAR -2000 -620 112 32 5
setpos -2500 -100 196 0 0
wait 1
shot elevator
# stats record before the first crossing
stats seam1-before
# elevator button #81 (master button_lock, opened by the doors) → doors close
# → eledoordelaymm → changetohldemo2 (USEONLY, changetarget elestartmm)
+use
wait 0.3
-use
waitmap hldemo2 600
shot seam1-at

# ---- B: hldemo2, first visit → hldemo3 (derived on the old tree's host build) ----
# ---- Segment B: hldemo2 first visit (start elevator -> trigger_changelevel hldemo2_3 -> hldemo3)
# Crawl spaces (pipe duct behind the soda machine, ceiling vent) are crossed
# ducked (+duck).
waitmap hldemo2 60
# arrival: seam switch into the start elevator (landmark hldemo1to2)
waitnear -452 -100 196 1 0
# stats record after the first crossing (the hldemo2 arrival)
stats seam1-after
look 0 8
# changetarget elestartmm (fired by the hldemo1 changelevel) opens the elevator doors
waitmoved startele1 20
shot hldemo2-arrival
# soda room: trigger_multiple #591 opens soda_room_door
setpos -368 120 196 0 90
waitmoved soda_room_door 5
# crowbar from the shelf, then bust the soda machine (func_breakable #106, health
# 15: two crowbar hits -> busted_soda_mm; 7 s later busted_wall_mm tips
# soda_machine_shell over and breaks busted_pipes_cover). The shell is a
# func_door_rotating with dmg 9999 that falls 91 degrees towards -y (tip at y 180):
# a player in its arc is crushed (GoldSrc CBaseDoor::Blocked), so step west
# out of it (the shell spans x ~-320..-240; the room's south wall starts at
# y ~180, so -280 150 is inside the wall and leaves the player stuck)
# until it lies still (91 degrees at 175/s: ~0.5 s)
setpos -416 290 196 0 0
wait 0.3
setpos -280 260 196 0 90
impulse 1
wait 0.5
+attack
wait 2
-attack
setpos -416 210 196 0 90
waitgone busted_pipes_cover 15
wait 1
# steam valve func_rot_button #634 -> steam_off_mm turns busted_pipes_smoke off
# (stand on the fallen machine shell at y 270: the hull stays clear of the
# steam's trigger_hurt #141, y 296..328, which scalds 10 per 0.5 s)
setpos -262 270 196 0 75
wait 0.5
+use
wait 0.2
-use
waitgone busted_pipes_smoke 3
wait 2
# pipe duct: the pipe stubs in the steam-pipe hole leave the crouch hull a slit
# (origin x -268..-264.25, z 178..180), so line up ducked on the shell at x -266
# (the valve use leaves the player a few units east), crawl north off the shell
# through the hole, east, north to ladder #639 and strafe into it: it climbs
# ducked into the ceiling vent, crawl east along it
+duck
wait 0.5
setpos -266 282 196 0 90
+forward
waitnear -266 384 178 6 10
-forward
+moveright
waitnear -240 384 178 6 10
-moveright
wait 0.5
# HEV flashlight (impulse 100), looking down the dark duct north to its
# floor: HLSDK player.cpp drains 1 unit per FLASH_DRAIN_TIME 1.2 s while
# on; the log's flashlight lines and the stats lines' battery field carry
# the numbers
look 20 90
wait 0.3
shot duct-dark
impulse 100
wait 0.3
shot duct-flashlight
stats flashlight-on
look 0 90
+forward
waitnear -229 566 178 6 10
-forward
shot vent-flashlight
+moveright
waitnear 16 568 426 12 20
-moveright
# vent south (backwards): touch trigger_once #644 -> shotgun_ventbreak drops the vent
# floor onto the ceiling tiles; trigger_once #642 (delay 1) -> shotgun_ceiling breaks,
# fall into the room. From here on headcrabs (shotgun room, barney's crab ambush)
# and the crate zombie bite and claw a route that does not fight them (old host
# without god: dead at the tripmine barrier, 100 hp of 10 hp bites and a 20 hp
# slash): god, combat is not under test.
god 1
+back
waitgone shotgun_ventbreak 15
waitgone shotgun_ceiling 6
-back
wait 1
-duck
# flashlight off: recharges 1 unit per FLASH_CHARGE_TIME 0.2 s
impulse 100
wait 0.1
stats flashlight-off
# shotgun pickup
setpos -35 242 196 0 0
wait 0.3
# trigger_once #658 unlocks shotgun_door_master; walk into door #659 -> barney_crab_ambush_ss_rl
setpos 40 196 196 0 270
wait 0.5
+forward
wait 1
-forward
wait 1
# hallway: 9mm handgun + clips
setpos -20 136 196 0 0
wait 0.3
stats flashlight-recharge
# touch-door #62 into the barney room (barney_38_sentence trigger #672 beyond)
setpos 76 48 196 0 0
wait 0.3
+forward
wait 1.5
-forward
wait 2
# east corridor (autosave #596), zombie corridor
setpos 440 -40 196 0 0
wait 0.3
setpos 840 -40 196 0 270
wait 0.3
setpos 840 -300 196 0 270
wait 0.3
# trigger_once #593 -> zombie_crates break, zombie released
setpos 840 -372 196 0 270
waitgone zombie_crates 2
wait 2
# tripmine corridor: low wooden barrier #201 (health 20) - crowbar it
setpos 908 -440 196 45 0
impulse 1
wait 0.6
+attack
wait 2
-attack
# break the high beams of mines #206/#207: chain reaction takes out #204 (its floor breakable #208
# fires tripmine_explosion_mm) and the far barrier #205 with mines #202/#203
setpos 958 -440 196 0 0
wait 1
setpos 1113 -440 196 0 0
wait 2.5
# west ledge, down the stairs to the warehouse floor
setpos 1340 -440 196 0 270
wait 0.3
setpos 1378 -600 196 0 0
wait 0.3
setpos 1800 -600 100 0 0
wait 0.5
setpos 2050 -600 -60 0 90
wait 0.3
# trigger_once #245 -> gate_grunt_1 scripts: frontkick breaks gate_button_1, warehouse_gate_1 closes
setpos 1900 -6 -60 0 90
waitmoved warehouse_gate_1 20
# ladder #312 up to the east walkway; crane button #225 -> warehouse_crane
setpos 2128 880 196 0 270
wait 0.3
setpos 2135 310 196 35 0
wait 0.6
+use
wait 0.2
-use
# ladder #312 continues to the wall-top ledge (z 304); step onto the crane beam once it parks north
setpos 2152 920 341 0 180
wait 0.3
waitmoved warehouse_crane 15
setpos 2100 982 341 0 180
wait 0.3
# down into the crane cab, step off its north edge over the closed gate into the yard
# (trigger_once #319 -> init_trailer_mortars_mm, fallback_grunts_mm). The yard
# player picks up sideways velocity during the drop (lands ~40-90 units NW),
# so accept any yard-floor spot (r 100 excludes the 49/68/156/196 cab ledges)
setpos 1830 1020 156 0 90
wait 0.5
setpos 1830 1072 156 0 90
waitnear 1830 1072 -60 100 4
wait 4
# trigger_once #242 unlocks gate_lock_1; button #235 reopens warehouse_gate_1 (return path)
setpos 2013 1080 -60 30 270
wait 0.5
+use
wait 0.2
-use
wait 2
# ladder #315 from the yard up to the catwalk (z 160)
setpos 2352 1124 -60 -60 90
wait 0.3
+forward
waitnear 2352 1170 196 40 5
-forward
# catwalk south to trailer_door_2 (trigger_multiple #310), through the door and down into the trailer yard
# (the drop slides down the trailer deck's east face: at 72 fps the player reaches the
# yard floor (z -60), at 17 fps it landed on the z 60 ledge beside the deck;
# either is off the catwalk, the next waypoint is on the yard floor)
setpos 2466 1000 196 0 270
wait 0.3
setpos 2466 915 196 0 270
wait 1.5
+forward
wait 0.6
-forward
waitnear 2466 780 0 90 4
# MP5 + clip on the radio table under the trailer deck
setpos 2246 716 -60 0 270
wait 0.5
# under the trailer deck: fallback squad (fallback_grunt_2 + squad 2) engages the player
setpos 2440 706 -58 0 180
wait 2.5
shot grunts-fight
# east yard: trigger_once #456 -> sci_execution monstermakers
setpos 2800 560 -60 0 270
wait 0.3
setpos 2800 522 -60 0 0
wait 3
# north along the east yard: burnpile trigger #667, autosave #604
setpos 3000 760 -60 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 3000 840 -60 0 90
wait 1
setpos 2888 1046 -60 0 90
wait 0.5
setpos 3028 1282 -60 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 3012 1506 -60 0 90
wait 0.3
# over the rubble pile onto the dome road
setpos 2980 1714 -49 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 2884 1826 33 0 90
wait 0.5
setpos 2916 2034 -60 0 90
wait 0.5
setpos 2724 2082 -60 0 180
wait 0.3
setpos 2580 2178 -60 0 180
wait 0.3
stats hldemo2
# the approach to the exit: a walking player spends ~2 s in the seam's
# approach box, which prefetches hldemo3's seam set before the switch
setpos 2404 2242 -60 0 180
wait 2
shot hldemo2-exit
# stats record before the second crossing
stats seam2-before
# trigger_changelevel #45 (landmark hldemo2_3) -> hldemo3: the eye is in
# the seam's switch box
setpos 2298 2256 -60 0 180
waitmap hldemo3 30
shot seam2-at

# ---- C: hldemo3: dish → global → hldemo2 (derived on the old tree's host build) ----
# ---- Segment C: hldemo3 (dish dome) -> back to hldemo2 (landmark hldemo2_3b)
waitmap hldemo3 30
god 0
# arrival: seam switch beside landmark hldemo2_3
waitnear -438 -576 -476 1 0
look 0 177
wait 0.5
shot hldemo3-arrival
stats hldemo3
# end of the M4 route: the hldemo3 arrival (segment C is the M5 route)
pass
